o... arde.","e":"But it's so small and so... not flaming.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"bd86c7db93ba59543dfc22211c435c0d","i":"07305bf1f6732b3db16bde08cc719020","r":"6208168:6975090:43:3832090","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6208168","6975090","43"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Dicen que arde incluso bajo el agua.","e":"They say it even burns under water.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"84dd7ff3d9ddab3f49237b60c6a9cfe1","i":"68f7ecbd1ee04235f3f24094a5bc9ed0","r":"5985752:6965550:482:3631254","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5985752","6965550","482"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Todo mi cuerpo está que arde.","e":"My entire body is on fire.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"4acb658d0943144870d54ff6fe75ef60","i":"2a34584328ddd352560ee9ca7337a5f2","r":"6013782:6996537:35:2652876","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6013782","6996537","35"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Cuando la madera arde, ponemos más.","e":"When the wood burns, we add more.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"aa18461ddd787505d5cf7c29e4421acf","i":"924b5b1e33bfbb46194c52902fb02711","r":"5471906:6522440:567:2103365","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5471906","6522440","567"],"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"La leña mojada no arde bien.","e":"Wet firewood doesn't burn well.","s":"tatoeba","x":"c55c36ee37fa92eae5648aa4c208d771","i":"e1ea856ce7045527d8ef26fc27052a1f","r":"2259818:2259817","c":"cueyayotl","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2259818","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2259818","b":"Tatoeba sentence #2259818 by cueyayotl; English translation #2259817 by _undertoad","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/2259818","tu":1,"w":["leaf",1]},{"t":"Durante los ocho minutos que arde, no se puede apagar con agua ni con arena.","e":"During the 8 minutes it burns, it can't be put out with water nor sand.","s":"opensubtitles","x":"658bee006696df5d191dfba515d9d474","i":"204840f4e6c41bc0ea2ba5fd71cb99d3","r":"2556114:6856396:698:159630","su":"http://op